# Optional extra test classes for tools/test: one class name per line, '#' starts a comment.
#
# You normally do NOT need this file. Any class named *Test in package com.wizzcraft.ima.core,
# placed under tools/test/com/wizzcraft/ima/core/, is found automatically, and every
# "static void testSomething()" method in it runs. Use this list only for a test class whose
